  "text": "proprium.beata-maria-virgo-regina-tractus",
  "about": "The tractus of the formulary “Queenship of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Rejoice, O Virgin Mary: you alone have destroyed all heresies. You believed what the Archangel Gabriel said. While a virgin, you bore God and man, and after giving birth, O Virgin, you remained inviolate. Mother of God, intercede for us." }
